OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from parade
OL,4,Aalong lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has imposed
OL,7,Frestrictions on the Apprentice Boys,
OL,8,Fbanning them from walking along the
OL,9,Fmainly nationalist lower Ormeau Road.
OL,11,FThe Belfast Walker Club had submitted
OL,12,Fan application for 7 November to parade
OL,13,Ffrom Ballynafeigh Orange Hall along the
OL,14,FOrmeau Road, across Ormeau Bridge and
OL,15,Fonwards to Donegall Pass.
OL,17,FThe parade has not been permitted to
OL,18,Fproceed down this part of the road
OL,19,Fsince 1999.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
